  "narrative": {
    "text": "UML class diagram in a frame tabbed 'Core profile', reproduced small: most attribute text is not legible at the extracted resolution, so only the larger class names are transcribed here, as drawn. Upper half: PhysicalLocation (attributes including country, countryCode, city, postalCode, postOfficeBoxNumber, provinceStateCode, streetAddress, geographicPointLocation), Location (locationTime), Requirement, Person, Organization (headquartersLocation : Location), SoftwareAgent and Agent; Element at the centre, with Annotation, Relationship, ElementCollection, SpdxDocument, Bundle, Bom, IndividualElement and LifecycleScopedRelationship around it; Tool and Artifact; DefinedProcess (processVersion, processRationale, processReadiness : ProcessReadinessType); Regulation pointing to Specification; and Action (actionStartTime, actionEndTime, actionLocation : Location, additionalInformation). Specification and Action each carry one attribute row shaded red. A 'Non-Element Classes' frame holds CreationInfo, ExternalIdentifier, ExternalMap, DictionaryEntry, ExternalRef, PositiveIntegerRange, NamespaceMap, IntegrityMethod with Hash and PackageVerificationCode, UnitOfMeasure (quantity, unitQUDT) with MeasureOfMass and MeasureOfLength, DefinedType and RequirementContext. A 'Simple Data Types' frame lists DateTime, MediaType, SemVer and one further type, and an 'Enumerations' frame lists about twelve enumeration names that are not reliably legible at this size.",
